      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/rainier-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rainier was once home to the Trojan Nuclear Power Plant, the only commercial nuclear reactor in the state of Oregon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
